[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0020","text":"请进……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0030","text":"辛苦了，日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0040","text":"辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0050","text":"今天真是够忙乱的啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0060","text":"……白白赶了一通，浪费体力\n真是────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0070","text":"时间还充裕，慢慢换衣服吧\n日花要是愿意的话，回去路上买点甜的东西？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0080","text":"……不用了\n我想早点回去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0090","text":"这样啊，明白了\n那我在外面等你"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400500_03_0100","text":"────不需要，那种东西"}]
